sentences.l:
“Antinous, insolence holding, evil-deviser, and moreover they say you
in the land of Ithaca among those of your age to be the best
in plan and in speech;

sentences.t:
μάργε, τίη δὲ σὺ Τηλεμάχῳ θάνατόν τε μόρον τε
ῥάπτεις, οὐδ’ ἱκέτας ἐμπάζεαι, οἷσιν ἄρα Ζεὺς
μάρτυρος;

sentences.tr:
marge, tiē de sy Tēlemachōi thanaton te moron te
rhapteis, oud’ hiketas empazeai, hoisin ara Zeus
martyros;

sentences.l:
for they were greatly angry indeed,
because, following raiders, Taphian ones,
he grieved the Thesprotians;

Therefore to me Telemachus of all by far dearest is
of men, and not at all him death to fear do I bid
from the suitors, at least;

Already above the city, where the Hermaean hill is,
I was going, when a ship, swift, I saw coming down
into our harbour;
